; A clock-in line must name an account.  A bare "i DATE TIME" line is
; an error, even when an earlier, longer line left bytes in the reused
; line buffer that could be read as an account name.

; 345678901234567890123Stale:Account  junk
i 2024/01/15 09:00:00

test bal -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 6:
Error: Clock-in directive requires an account
end test
